          </span>
          <h1 className="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-navy dark:text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
            면접의 모든 순간을<br />
            <span className="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-500">데이터로 완벽하게 분석하다</span>
